def read : (Ran SPi w _ (Lan SMu N [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) Nat) := (Sec SPi w n (Lan SMu N [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) [n => (Elim SMu N [] n as x return Nat with | (ACtor zero)  => 1 | (ACtor succ) m => 2)])
